# Line endings the interpreters require, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# bash chokes on CRLF; cmd.exe mis-parses some LF-only batch files. Both are
# stored LF in the repo and checked out as the interpreter wants them, so
# scripts/gen-bat-wrappers.sh --check compares like with like on every OS.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
